{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06454","headline":"长寿寺粲公院新甃井 · 李颀","name":"长寿寺粲公院新甃井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧房来往久，露井每同观。\n白石抱新甃，苍苔依旧栏。\n空瓶宛转下，长绠辘轳盘。\n境界因心净，泉源见底寒。\n钟鸣时灌顶，对此日闲安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}